WEBVTT

00:00.587 --> 00:09.444
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.587 --> 00:09.444
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.957 --> 00:18.529
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.957 --> 00:18.529
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.671 --> 00:37.246
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.671 --> 00:37.246
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.620 --> 00:46.806
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.620 --> 00:46.807
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.040 --> 00:56.173
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.040 --> 00:56.174
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.333 --> 01:05.440
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.333 --> 01:05.440
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.789 --> 01:14.837
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.796 --> 01:14.837
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.857 --> 01:22.832
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.857 --> 01:22.832
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.765 --> 01:30.685
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.604 --> 01:33.939
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.815 --> 01:35.858
Black Jack.

01:56.276 --> 01:56.834
Suction.

01:57.069 --> 01:57.568
Yes.

01:58.410 --> 01:58.959
Vitals.

01:59.238 --> 02:00.750
Saturation is stable.

02:01.198 --> 02:01.823
Good.

02:01.824 --> 02:02.933
Switching to the post operation process.

02:03.242 --> 02:03.558
Yes.

02:08.089 --> 02:09.769
Operation in progress

02:12.175 --> 02:14.642
You saved us, Black Jack.

02:15.216 --> 02:16.324
Dr. Yamadano.

02:16.532 --> 02:18.910
It was just amazing.

02:19.243 --> 02:20.313
You have my greatest admiration.

02:20.578 --> 02:22.129
No, not that good.

02:22.371 --> 02:25.206
But let me give you one piece of advice.

02:26.041 --> 02:29.115
Don't underestimate the human body.

02:29.462 --> 02:30.378
No matter what.

02:31.380 --> 02:32.547
What do you mean?

02:32.798 --> 02:37.028
I mean that you can't always treat humans theoretically.

02:37.317 --> 02:40.263
You will suffer a severe setback at some point.

02:40.973 --> 02:42.881
Remember that.

02:43.350 --> 02:44.806
I know, Doctor.

02:51.976 --> 02:55.149
The missing Needle

03:11.802 --> 03:12.879
Hey, Sharaku!

03:14.129 --> 03:15.281
Kong!

03:15.909 --> 03:17.356
What's wrong, Sharaku?

03:17.442 --> 03:19.318
I haven't talked to you in a while.

03:19.470 --> 03:21.554
Are you trying to avoid us?

03:21.639 --> 03:23.264
Oh, no.

03:24.058 --> 03:25.595
You can have this, so...

03:25.642 --> 03:31.189
No, we want to see what's under your bandage.

03:31.982 --> 03:34.895
There's only a boil under it!

03:35.008 --> 03:36.992
Then why are you trying so hard to hide it?

03:37.113 --> 03:38.256
It's just...

03:39.323 --> 03:41.116
a habit.

03:41.117 --> 03:41.950
Oh, come on!

03:41.951 --> 03:42.992
Stop it!

03:44.328 --> 03:45.203
Give it up.

03:46.228 --> 03:47.414
Hey! Do it!

03:47.415 --> 03:48.123
Yeah!

03:49.500 --> 03:50.625
Stop it!

03:55.490 --> 03:56.965
Give it up.

04:01.683 --> 04:02.683
Stop that!

04:02.847 --> 04:03.340
Who is it?!

04:05.182 --> 04:07.172
I'm the righteous hero, Pinocoman!

04:07.309 --> 04:12.021
You bullies! If you bully that kid
anymore, I won't forgive you!

04:12.419 --> 04:14.470
What? Wanna fight?

04:14.692 --> 04:15.483
A kid like you?

04:16.402 --> 04:17.527
I'm not a kid.

04:19.905 --> 04:22.131
I am 18 years old!

04:27.413 --> 04:28.538
What a turn off.

04:28.998 --> 04:29.831
Let's go.

04:31.829 --> 04:34.357
Sharaku, I'll let you go for today.

04:34.696 --> 04:35.925
Hurry up, guys!

04:35.925 --> 04:36.713
Yeah!

04:43.929 --> 04:46.514
A boy should be stronger!

04:46.807 --> 04:49.601
You should beat up those bullies!

04:49.627 --> 04:50.507
That's impossible.

04:50.607 --> 04:53.284
I'm weak and timid.

04:53.374 --> 04:55.809
That's why you need to be stronger!

04:56.020 --> 04:58.529
But that's so sudden...

05:00.942 --> 05:01.613
Fine.

05:01.801 --> 05:03.948
Then I'll train you.

05:04.617 --> 05:05.450
You will?

05:05.451 --> 05:05.792
Yup.

05:05.918 --> 05:09.999
I'll train you hard, until you get so
strong that you can beat them up.

05:16.629 --> 05:17.641
That's good.

05:17.797 --> 05:19.672
A friend for Sharaku-kun, huh?

05:19.997 --> 05:22.774
Yeah. I guess this friend is a girl.

05:23.094 --> 05:26.221
He's so happy about it, and he
wouldn't stop talking about her.

05:26.597 --> 05:31.017
You were so worried that he wouldn't make any friends.

05:31.018 --> 05:31.935
But it's funny.

05:32.729 --> 05:34.921
"You are a boy, so you must be strong."

05:35.106 --> 05:38.149
And he's getting trained every day by her.

05:39.026 --> 05:40.091
By that girl?

05:40.319 --> 05:40.719
Yup.

05:42.196 --> 05:44.079
Sharaku-kun must have a sister complex.

05:44.323 --> 05:44.864
How come?

05:45.199 --> 05:49.411
Sharaku-kun must like strong girls like you, Wato-san.

05:49.703 --> 05:53.248
Are you calling this frail girl, strong?

05:53.738 --> 05:57.293
What part of you is frail while you beat up guys?

05:58.295 --> 05:59.216
You knew that?

05:59.232 --> 06:02.652
I'm happy to have such a strong friend.

06:02.299 --> 06:03.258
Oh, that's going too far!

06:04.115 --> 06:05.091
A friend, huh?

06:05.302 --> 06:06.428
Yeah!

06:06.595 --> 06:09.889
My first friend!

06:10.099 --> 06:13.893
He has a bandage on his forehead, and is super shy!

06:13.894 --> 06:15.603
And he's so cute!

06:18.232 --> 06:19.649
I guess she mentioned that.

06:25.656 --> 06:27.282
Today, we'll have a hands-on practice.

06:27.825 --> 06:28.450
Hands-on?

06:28.598 --> 06:30.668
I'm going to fight you.

06:31.453 --> 06:32.453
You will?

06:32.499 --> 06:34.633
Just do it!

06:36.553 --> 06:38.179
Um, Pinoco-chan.

06:38.180 --> 06:39.083
What?

06:39.431 --> 06:40.139
Thank you.

06:41.433 --> 06:45.778
I'm so happy that you care so much about me, so...

06:47.291 --> 06:48.773
What are you talking about?!

06:48.774 --> 06:50.358
Now, let's get started!

06:51.110 --> 06:51.984
Yeah!

06:54.614 --> 06:55.681
Here I come.

06:55.781 --> 06:56.821
Ready or not!

07:02.579 --> 07:04.872
Ohmigewdness!

07:05.165 --> 07:08.835
Hey, I haven't done anything, yet!

07:09.461 --> 07:11.838
Sharaku-kun! Hang on!

07:12.464 --> 07:13.339
Sharaku-kun!

07:13.966 --> 07:15.231
Sharaku-kun!

07:22.349 --> 07:24.142
It's quite severe.

07:24.143 --> 07:26.144
This must not be his first time.

07:26.562 --> 07:28.747
I wish we'd found it a little earlier.

07:28.897 --> 07:29.605
Yeah.

07:29.606 --> 07:30.648
We can't help it.

07:31.650 --> 07:33.359
N-no way...

07:36.238 --> 07:38.781
Doc!

07:41.326 --> 07:42.285
What's wrong, Pinoco?

07:42.286 --> 07:46.706
Doc, please help my friend, Sharaku-kun!

07:53.255 --> 07:54.314
30,000,000?!

07:54.631 --> 07:55.298
That's right.

07:55.758 --> 07:57.074
I advise against it!

07:57.343 --> 07:59.927
Why would you have this notorious surgeon do it?

08:00.637 --> 08:03.712
I came here because I heard, you
can't treat him in this hospital.

08:03.849 --> 08:05.725
Yes, the operation is difficult.

08:06.643 --> 08:07.501
30,000,000...

08:07.853 --> 08:09.020
He's Black Jack.

08:09.021 --> 08:13.316
He's skilled but is a crooked doctor
who charges outrageous fees.

08:13.867 --> 08:17.653
I think 30,000,000 is cheap compared to a person's life.

08:18.322 --> 08:21.032
But my parents are overseas for business.

08:21.033 --> 08:22.325
It's time-critical.

08:23.048 --> 08:24.088
You decide, yourself.

08:24.468 --> 08:25.453
Aren't you his family?

08:26.121 --> 08:28.539
30,000,000, and not a penny less.

08:38.342 --> 08:39.068
Fine.

08:39.343 --> 08:40.468
I'll ask you to do it.

08:41.345 --> 08:43.568
But please, save my brother!

08:43.887 --> 08:44.621
Don't worry.

08:45.641 --> 08:47.105
I guarantee his safety.

09:03.784 --> 09:04.668
Let's start.

09:04.952 --> 09:05.346
Yes.

09:05.828 --> 09:06.609
Scalpel.

09:08.248 --> 09:08.848
Drain.

09:09.039 --> 09:10.373
Inserting the drain.

09:10.374 --> 09:11.082
Pulse?

09:11.083 --> 09:12.629
76. All normal.

09:12.960 --> 09:13.668
Clamps.

09:13.669 --> 09:14.092
Yes.

09:15.045 --> 09:15.740
Vacuum.

09:16.004 --> 09:16.796
Amazing.

09:16.797 --> 09:18.089
Look at his work.

09:18.090 --> 09:20.383
He has a fast, yet accurate approach.

09:20.634 --> 09:22.779
He's just like a skilled chef.

09:22.928 --> 09:25.066
Yeah, he's really beyond us.

09:25.389 --> 09:27.390
This level of operation is not a problem.

09:34.648 --> 09:36.149
Thoracic suture is complete.

09:36.150 --> 09:38.484
Both blood pressure and heart rate are normal.

09:38.485 --> 09:39.485
The operation has been completed successfully.

09:39.486 --> 09:41.225
I appreciate the staff's help.

09:48.704 --> 09:51.441
Pinoco-chan, how can you eat at a time-like this?

09:51.790 --> 09:54.876
I get especially hungry at times like this.

09:54.877 --> 09:55.715
Do you want some?

09:56.023 --> 09:56.703
Thanks.

09:59.673 --> 10:00.490
Doc!

10:00.888 --> 10:03.312
Doctor, how's Sharaku, my brother? -

10:03.552 --> 10:05.386
I told you I'd guarantee his safety.

10:05.387 --> 10:05.720
So...

10:06.847 --> 10:08.306
The operation was a success.

10:10.851 --> 10:11.933
Thank goodness.

10:11.942 --> 10:13.811
I just knew it.

10:14.146 --> 10:16.072
He just needs an IV now to recover.

10:16.231 --> 10:17.388
Take care of the rest.

10:17.649 --> 10:18.400
Yes, sir.

10:18.734 --> 10:19.624
Let's go, Pinoco.

10:19.702 --> 10:20.777
Aye aye, sir.

10:22.029 --> 10:23.738
Thank you, Doctor.

10:27.326 --> 10:28.159
Move!!!

10:29.036 --> 10:30.203
Make way!

10:30.204 --> 10:30.931
It's an emergency!

10:34.249 --> 10:36.334
Watch out! Jeez!

10:38.348 --> 10:38.927
Let's go!

10:40.161 --> 10:41.673
Wait up, Doc!

10:43.342 --> 10:43.800
Doctor!

10:44.259 --> 10:45.718
Dr. Black Jack!

10:59.690 --> 11:00.450
What happened?

11:01.003 --> 11:03.370
Dr. Black Jack, the patient...

11:03.766 --> 11:04.805
Has his condition worsened?

11:05.007 --> 11:06.007
No.

11:06.300 --> 11:09.469
While we were transferring him
to another room with an IV...

11:13.724 --> 11:14.516
It's an emergency!

11:14.517 --> 11:15.183
Move!!!

11:23.609 --> 11:25.026
The stretcher collided with us,

11:25.611 --> 11:28.113
and the needle broke because of it.

11:28.698 --> 11:29.724
That's absurd!

11:30.116 --> 11:31.173
The needle broke?!

11:32.118 --> 11:33.002
Wait, where's the piece?

11:33.442 --> 11:37.914
We are guessing it's still inside, flowing through the veins.

11:38.499 --> 11:39.833
Look at this X-ray.

11:41.919 --> 11:43.181
This is the patient's right arm.

11:43.504 --> 11:46.214
This black shadow in the center of the arm...

11:46.215 --> 11:47.424
That's the broken piece.

11:47.652 --> 11:49.111
And this is thirty seconds later.

11:49.302 --> 11:51.594
It's moving through the vein.

11:52.059 --> 11:52.907
That's only natural.

11:53.097 --> 11:55.557
Blood flows through the body constantly.

11:56.934 --> 12:03.315
Including capillaries, blood flows through the veins to the
heart, through the lungs, and then to the arteries.

12:05.401 --> 12:11.031
The needle is probably heading for the heart,
while getting stuck every now and then.

12:13.409 --> 12:15.565
If the needle reaches the heart...

12:15.911 --> 12:17.822
If it stabs the heart wall...

12:17.997 --> 12:20.049
If it harms the heart valve...

12:22.710 --> 12:25.443
Even if it goes through the heart
unharmed, the lungs come after that.

12:25.713 --> 12:27.193
That's even worse.

12:28.299 --> 12:31.009
If it pricks the lungs, he could have major bleeding.

12:31.594 --> 12:33.219
We must extract it, somehow.

12:33.220 --> 12:36.556
But how are we going to extract such a small object?

12:36.557 --> 12:39.643
It's constantly moving with the flow of the blood.

12:40.102 --> 12:43.521
Considering the current state of the patient,
such a major operation is not...

12:43.522 --> 12:46.066
Hey, what in the world is going on?

12:46.067 --> 12:47.692
What happened to Sharaku-kun?

12:47.693 --> 12:50.020
Has my brother's condition worsened?

12:51.906 --> 12:53.593
Wasn't the operation successful?

12:53.824 --> 12:55.909
How is Sharaku?!

12:56.452 --> 12:57.582
Doctor?!

12:58.496 --> 13:00.830
You said you'd guarantee his safety!

13:01.207 --> 13:02.173
Doctor!

13:03.102 --> 13:03.792
Of course.

13:04.293 --> 13:05.485
Get ready to operate again.

13:05.711 --> 13:07.712
And get a metal detector ready immediately.

13:07.781 --> 13:09.798
We will extract the needle before it reaches the heart.

13:09.799 --> 13:10.507
Yes!

13:12.118 --> 13:12.968
The needle...

13:29.122 --> 13:30.402
We have the target.

13:31.195 --> 13:33.083
It's in the vein around the right clavicle.

13:33.322 --> 13:35.865
It will reach the superior vena cava
soon, leading to the heart.

13:36.700 --> 13:39.119
The operation will get more
complicated if it enters the vein.

13:39.120 --> 13:41.830
Before that happens, we will clamp the blood flow
to stop it from entering the superior vena cava,

13:41.831 --> 13:43.782
and extract the needle at this spot.

13:44.208 --> 13:45.100
Right here.

13:45.918 --> 13:49.287
The patient is exhausted-from the
previous operation already.

13:49.505 --> 13:50.922
The elongated stoppage of blood would be...

13:50.923 --> 13:51.383
I Know.

13:52.300 --> 13:54.718
But it's also true that the patient is
in danger if we leave him like this.

13:55.511 --> 13:57.156
Will the needle's movement be faster,

13:57.305 --> 13:59.140
or will my treatment?

13:59.307 --> 14:01.016
It's a race against time.

14:02.180 --> 14:03.627
Operation in progress

14:04.496 --> 14:06.187
It began.

14:06.187 --> 14:09.872
Please... save Sharaku.

14:13.529 --> 14:14.962
Make an incision above the clavicle.

14:15.197 --> 14:16.025
Location of the needle?

14:16.282 --> 14:17.418
Approaching the incision spot.

14:17.617 --> 14:19.242
It is moving at the expected speed.

14:19.910 --> 14:20.466
Vitals?

14:20.703 --> 14:21.745
Still normal.

14:22.413 --> 14:24.414
Good. At this rate, I can...

14:25.499 --> 14:26.274
There's a problem!

14:27.001 --> 14:28.710
The needle is moving faster!

14:28.711 --> 14:29.178
What?!

14:29.420 --> 14:30.646
The flow got faster?

14:30.796 --> 14:33.830
No, because the vein is bigger, it's getting stuck less often.

14:34.300 --> 14:35.717
Doctor, please hurry!

14:35.718 --> 14:38.053
Or else, the needle will pass through the point!

14:38.054 --> 14:38.903
I know!

14:40.056 --> 14:41.909
The needle is approaching the point.

14:42.850 --> 14:44.684
Good, the vein is exposed now.

14:46.771 --> 14:47.826
The needle is passing through!

14:47.980 --> 14:48.590
Doctor!

14:49.260 --> 14:50.678
Tying the vein!

15:00.201 --> 15:00.965
No good!

15:01.202 --> 15:02.911
The needle passed through the tied spot!

15:04.330 --> 15:05.308
We were too late.

15:05.623 --> 15:07.238
The needle moved on to the vena cava.

15:07.416 --> 15:08.825
It's headed for the heart!

15:13.714 --> 15:14.756
There's still a way.

15:17.301 --> 15:18.692
Quickly, suture the incision spot.

15:18.928 --> 15:19.803
Stabilize the blood pressure!

15:19.804 --> 15:20.178
Right!

15:20.805 --> 15:22.722
Get the artificial cardiopulmonary device!

15:22.723 --> 15:23.139
Right.

15:29.730 --> 15:30.655
Sharaku...

15:31.899 --> 15:33.471
We have the artificial cardiopulmonary device ready.

15:33.734 --> 15:34.401
We're set.

15:34.967 --> 15:37.156
We will connect the vena cava to the artificial heart-lung,

15:37.280 --> 15:38.681
and lead the needle toward it.

15:38.823 --> 15:40.115
That way, the heart will be safe.

15:42.118 --> 15:44.411
The needle will reach the heart in one minute.

15:44.412 --> 15:45.370
Doctor, we can't...

15:45.371 --> 15:46.321
Yes, I will make it!

15:46.872 --> 15:47.580
Disinfection!

15:47.581 --> 15:48.081
Yes.

15:48.365 --> 15:50.375
It's impossible, even for him.

15:50.376 --> 15:51.911
We won't make it.

15:56.048 --> 15:56.595
Scalpel.

15:56.757 --> 15:57.632
And clamps.

15:57.925 --> 15:58.508
Hurry!

15:58.509 --> 15:58.995
Yes!

16:00.511 --> 16:01.344
20 seconds!

16:01.345 --> 16:02.429
It's impossible!

16:02.430 --> 16:03.336
Don't give up!

16:03.431 --> 16:05.265
I'm trying to make the impossible, possible!

16:07.226 --> 16:08.274
15 seconds!

16:08.602 --> 16:09.346
Damn...

16:13.899 --> 16:15.169
What speed...

16:15.359 --> 16:17.110
It's unreal.

16:17.111 --> 16:18.715
It's really an act of God.

16:19.727 --> 16:20.655
Or could it really be...

16:21.198 --> 16:22.616
It will reach the heart in 10 seconds!

16:23.159 --> 16:23.797
9...

16:24.302 --> 16:25.090
8...

16:25.411 --> 16:26.453
7...

16:26.808 --> 16:27.408
6...

16:27.942 --> 16:28.396
5...

16:28.956 --> 16:29.443
4...

16:30.249 --> 16:30.665
3...

16:31.375 --> 16:32.127
2...

16:39.383 --> 16:40.048
What's wrong?

16:40.384 --> 16:41.607
We lost the target.

16:42.053 --> 16:43.261
The needle disappeared!

16:43.376 --> 16:44.272
What?!

16:44.472 --> 16:45.979
How could that be?!

16:46.182 --> 16:48.520
Trace it through the vena cava again.

16:48.768 --> 16:49.512
Yes.

16:53.773 --> 16:54.575
It's nowhere.

16:56.806 --> 16:58.477
I can't find it anywhere.

16:58.653 --> 16:59.917
No way...

17:00.071 --> 17:01.237
How could it disappear?

17:01.656 --> 17:03.907
Or is it hidden behind another organ?

17:03.908 --> 17:04.935
Look more carefully!

17:05.868 --> 17:10.746
Maybe the sensor can't pick it up because
of all the clamps.and other instruments.

17:10.957 --> 17:12.749
I can't take off the instruments now.

17:12.750 --> 17:13.759
Take X-rays.

17:13.960 --> 17:14.668
Yes.

17:16.253 --> 17:17.629
The artificial cardiopulmonary device is set.

17:17.880 --> 17:18.831
Begin the operation.

17:19.173 --> 17:20.507
Check for foreign objects within the flow.

17:20.508 --> 17:21.132
Okay.

17:25.346 --> 17:25.934
And?

17:26.347 --> 17:27.030
No good.

17:27.264 --> 17:30.190
There are no foreign objects flowing through.

17:30.476 --> 17:32.037
What on Earth is going on?!

17:33.062 --> 17:34.479
Doctor, here's the X-ray.

17:35.773 --> 17:36.648
I don't see it.

17:36.649 --> 17:38.984
We can't see it in images from other angles either.

17:39.360 --> 17:42.445
It really looks like it has disappeared.

17:43.572 --> 17:45.732
Did it really?

17:46.534 --> 17:48.952
Prolonging the operation further will endanger the patient.

17:48.953 --> 17:51.510
But we haven't extracted the needle yet!

17:51.747 --> 17:53.164
But what can we do?

17:57.962 --> 17:58.612
Cancel it.

18:00.256 --> 18:01.365
Cancel the operation.

18:02.258 --> 18:03.258
Take care of the rest.

18:03.259 --> 18:04.067
Doctor!

18:04.681 --> 18:07.587
Operation in progress

18:09.809 --> 18:10.696
Doc!

18:11.488 --> 18:13.031
Doctor, how's Sharaku?

18:13.782 --> 18:15.837
I don't expect any fee from you.

18:43.687 --> 18:45.355
Pinoco, get the phone.

18:53.072 --> 18:53.852
Pinoco?

19:01.664 --> 19:02.158
Yes.

19:04.458 --> 19:05.416
What?!

19:05.834 --> 19:07.175
No way!

19:07.336 --> 19:08.460
I'm not lying.

19:08.837 --> 19:10.097
The needle came out.

19:10.339 --> 19:12.074
And believe it or not, from the original arm!

19:12.341 --> 19:13.758
It came out of the original arm?

19:13.759 --> 19:14.759
Stop kidding me.

19:14.760 --> 19:16.099
That's impossible!

19:16.261 --> 19:17.236
It's true!

19:17.388 --> 19:19.665
It came out of the vessel on the same arm.

19:19.890 --> 19:20.844
Vessel?!

19:21.684 --> 19:24.394
The needle that entered the vein came out of the vessel?!

19:25.229 --> 19:26.171
Yes.

19:26.563 --> 19:28.388
The needle took a very long trip.

19:28.691 --> 19:30.503
It moved from the right arm to the heart,

19:30.776 --> 19:33.604
from the heart to the lung, then entered the vessel

19:33.862 --> 19:36.481
Then it came back to the original right arm,

19:37.282 --> 19:38.915
without harming anything.

19:39.076 --> 19:42.537
So, just like how a mouth after
eating would spit out bad food,

19:43.289 --> 19:45.719
it came out naturally?

19:46.667 --> 19:47.792
Unbelievable.

19:48.877 --> 19:51.983
Then why did the needle disappear
suddenly during the operation?

19:52.589 --> 19:54.002
I don't know.

19:54.383 --> 19:55.563
I can only guess.

19:55.884 --> 19:58.877
Perhaps the needle had already passed
through both the heart and the lungs,

19:59.096 --> 20:00.722
and had entered the vessel.

20:01.890 --> 20:04.091
This is the proof.

20:12.693 --> 20:14.562
I'm happy. for you, Sharaku-kun.

20:15.195 --> 20:17.867
I can be free soon.

20:17.867 --> 20:18.573
Really?

20:18.782 --> 20:20.701
Then we can work hard again.

20:20.868 --> 20:21.680
On what?

20:21.680 --> 20:22.867
What else?

20:22.911 --> 20:25.121
Your training to beat up the bullies.

20:27.416 --> 20:28.833
That's right.

20:28.834 --> 20:31.127
Maybe I'll stay here a while longer.

20:31.128 --> 20:31.878
Sharaku!

20:32.338 --> 20:35.023
You have to fix your cowardice!

20:35.286 --> 20:36.372
Aren't you a man?

20:37.343 --> 20:41.121
I would just give those bullies a good beating.

20:50.397 --> 20:51.480
Dr. Black Jack.

20:52.441 --> 20:53.663
Thanks, Doctor.

20:53.942 --> 20:55.679
I couldn't do anything.

20:56.445 --> 20:57.414
That's not true.

20:57.529 --> 21:00.955
You really did save Sharaku.

21:01.533 --> 21:03.493
I'm sure a miracle happened, back then.

21:04.119 --> 21:04.703
A miracle?

21:05.037 --> 21:08.742
I heard that miracles come from
the effort that people make.

21:10.417 --> 21:13.878
Back then, you tried your best to save Sharaku.

21:14.838 --> 21:16.795
Other doctors and the nurse,

21:17.049 --> 21:18.270
Pinoco-chan and I,

21:18.475 --> 21:20.510
everyone's wishes made the miracle happen.

21:21.136 --> 21:21.856
But...

21:22.012 --> 21:23.137
It's not a theory!

21:23.138 --> 21:26.194
It's a miracle because you can't explain it theoretically!

21:27.226 --> 21:29.679
So, Doctor, thank you.

21:38.612 --> 21:40.446
Sharaku-kun...

21:41.031 --> 21:43.840
Don't underestimate the human body.

21:44.034 --> 21:46.617
You will suffer a severe setback at some point.

21:47.413 --> 21:49.094
The journey has only just begun.

22:07.122 --> 22:19.077
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.122 --> 22:19.077
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.195 --> 22:24.194
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.195 --> 22:24.194
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.763 --> 22:31.232
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.763 --> 22:31.232
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.776 --> 22:37.234
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.776 --> 22:37.234
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.838 --> 22:40.323
being heated up by you,

22:37.838 --> 22:40.323
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.532 --> 22:48.309
so much that I change color

22:40.532 --> 22:48.309
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.394 --> 23:00.163
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.394 --> 23:00.163
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.371 --> 23:12.102
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.371 --> 23:12.102
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.342 --> 23:23.693
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.342 --> 23:23.693
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.879 --> 23:28.800
I couldn't be happier

23:23.879 --> 23:28.800
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:29.028 --> 23:33.962
How does it taste?

23:29.028 --> 23:33.961
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.701 --> 23:46.701
I know him.

23:47.062 --> 23:47.978
I told you.

23:48.188 --> 23:49.438
The fee is 30,000,000 yen.

23:49.689 --> 23:51.292
Not a penny less.

23:51.474 --> 23:53.359
Ohmigewdness!

23:53.777 --> 23:55.238
Give me the wallet you stole.

24:02.077 --> 24:05.704
Then don't mind me, Dr. Black Jack!

24:06.581 --> 24:08.084
You know me?

24:08.375 --> 24:10.376
Yes! Get up!

24:10.842 --> 24:14.942
The Ant's Legs

24:11.197 --> 24:13.806
Next Karte - The Ant's Legs
